@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "username": "test1",
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### Login (token is captured for the next request)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test1",
 "password": "pass123"
}

### Get profile (uses token from the login request above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile
token: {{login.response.body.$.token}} 
